{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51606","headline":"谢新恩（六首） 一 · 李煜","name":"谢新恩（六首） 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"秦楼不见吹箫女，空余上苑风光。\n粉英含蕊自低昂。\n东风恼我，才发一襟香。\n琼窗梦□留残日，当年得恨何长。\n碧阑干外映垂杨。\n暂时相见，如梦懒思量。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李煜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51606.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51606","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}